&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Don’t&amp;nbsp;want to work on your birthday? We&amp;nbsp;don’t&amp;nbsp;either! Enjoy your day off on us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Enhanced maternity and paternity pay, depending on length of service.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Up to 10 days compassionate leave.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Buy back up to 3 days each year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Unlock 2 days volunteer leave after 12 months&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
