arbeitnow:senior-integrated-management-s:
&lt;div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"&gt;
&lt;div class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1" data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="cbf3e7ef-e52c-42cb-9a05-c43209602e50" data-turn-start-message="true" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-5-pro"&gt;
&lt;div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"&gt;
&lt;div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"&gt;
&lt;p class="PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer" data-start="135" data-end="148"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="150" data-end="249"&gt;Build the operating system that helps Graphcore scale quality, resilience and production readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="251" data-end="410"&gt;As an Integrated Management Systems Engineer, you will help shape the Graphcore way. This is our integrated approach to practical, scalable management systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="412" data-end="595"&gt;You will turn ISO 9001, ISO/IEC 27001, ISO 45001 and ISO 22301 requirements into usable ways of working. Your impact will reach engineering, operations, suppliers and corporate teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="597" data-end="781"&gt;Lead the delivery of the Integrated Management System internal audit programme, including audit planning and execution, reporting findings, agreeing corrective actions with process owners, and monitoring actions through to effective closure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="783" data-end="803"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team and culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="805" data-end="1015"&gt;You will work with Manufacturing Operations and Quality, partnering closely with engineering, operations and process owners. Work happens through direct problem solving, clear ownership and practical decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1017" data-end="1187"&gt;This role needs someone who can move between standards, systems and real workflows. You will challenge complexity and help teams build processes that people actually use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1189" data-end="1344"&gt;Decisions are grounded in evidence, risk and operational reality. You will be expected to speak up, take responsibility and help Graphcore improve at pace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1346" data-end="1368"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1370" data-end="1804"&gt;· Strong understanding of ISO 9001 principles in engineering or technology-led organisations&lt;br&gt;· Lead auditor qualification in ISO/IEC 27001, ISO 45001, ISO 22301 or ISO 9001&lt;br&gt;· Experience designing or improving management system processes&lt;br&gt;· Ability to translate standards into practical operating models&lt;br&gt;· Experience working in complex product development environments&lt;br&gt;· Structured problem-solving skills, such as A3, 5 Whys or Ishikawa&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1806" data-end="1814"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1816" data-end="2601"&gt;· Flexible working: Balance your work and personal life with greater flexibility&lt;br&gt;· Generous leave: Take time to rest, recharge and enjoy life outside of work&lt;br&gt;· Retirement planning support: Up to 5% matched pension&lt;br&gt;· Phantom equity: Share in Graphcore’s success&lt;br&gt;· Workplace experience: Enjoy thoughtfully designed office spaces for collaboration, with free food and an on-site barista to support your day Peace of mind protection: Income protection and life assurance to provide financial security for you and your loved ones&lt;br&gt;· Flexible benefits: Tailor your benefits package with a choice of additional options, including private medical insurance and dental cover&lt;br&gt;· Optional benefits: Dental cover, health cash plan, private medical insurance, cycle to work scheme, give as you earn&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2603" data-end="2965"&gt;We welcome people from all backgrounds and experiences and are committed to building an inclusive environment where everyone can do their best work.&lt;br&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer and recognise that everyone brings different strengths and perspectives. If you need any adjustments during the interview process, just let us know - we’re happy to support you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2967" data-end="2978"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sponsorship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2980" data-end="3136"&gt;Applicants must have the legal right to work in the UK. Unfortunately, we are unable to provide visa sponsorship or support visa applications for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3138" data-end="3164"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the team at Graphcore&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3166" data-end="3445"&gt;Graphcore is one of the world’s leading innovators in Artificial Intelligence compute. It is developing hardware, software and systems infrastructure that will unlock the next generation of AI breakthroughs and power the widespread adoption of AI solutions across every industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3447" data-end="3729"&gt;As part of the SoftBank Group, Graphcore is a member of an elite family of companies responsible for some of the world’s most transformative technologies. Together, they share a bold vision: to enable Artificial Super Intelligence and ensure its benefits are accessible to everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3731" data-end="4053"&gt;Graphcore’s teams are drawn from diverse backgrounds and bring a broad range of skills and perspectives. A melting pot of AI research specialists, silicon designers, software engineers and systems architects, Graphcore brings together deep expertise to solve complex problems and deliver meaningful progress in AI compute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="4055" data-end="4183" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""&gt;Ready to help Graphcore build management systems that enable scale, quality and resilience? Apply now to be part of the journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
